[en.FOCUS_C15_CRYSTAL_EMPIRE_TRUCE]
Crystal Empire Ceasefire

[en.FOCUS_C15_CRYSTAL_EMPIRE_TRUCE_desc]
In the autumn of 1000, the “Big Three” has conquered almost the entire central continent of Equestria. After Tirek returning to his hometown, Cozy Glow and Chrysalis set their sights on the Crystal Empire. But it is obviously a terrible choice to invade a northern frigid country in the fall. In the harsh winter of 1000, the armies of Tirek and Cozy Glow advanced slowly. Under the leadership of Princess Cadance and Shining Armor, the Crystal Empire organized a formidable defense force, and the Crystal Heart provided a powerful magical shield for the Crystal Empire’s army. The war seemed to be in a stalemate, but the resources of the Crystal Empire were slowly drying up, and the front line was shrinking bit by bit.\nBy the summer of the following year, the harsh winter could no longer protect the Crystal Empire, and the armies of Cozy Glow and Chrysalis launched a summer offensive again. The vanguard forces advanced to the outskirts of the capital, but they still could not break through the powerful magical shield of the Crystal Heart. As summer quickly turned into autumn, winter was not far away. For the Crystal Empire, the harsh winter was both a shelter and a dagger in the back: Cozy Glow and Chrysalis had to break the Crystal Heart before winter, but if the magical shield of the Crystal Heart was broken, the Crystal Empire and the invading army would be swallowed up altogether, by the severe cold of the Windigos. In the end, Cozy Glow and Chrysalis had to back down to the Crystal Empire, and even the once most resolute couple, Princess Cadance and Shining Armor, had to sit down at the negotiating table.\nThe “Big Three” and the Crystal Empire decided to compromise: Empress Cozy Glow promised the Crystal Empire freedom, but demanded that Princess Cadance and Shining Armor abdicate, the Crystal Empire will be come a nominal vassal of Equestria, be demilitarized, and the government must work with the Equestria Empire; Queen Chrysalis also guaranteed the independence of the Crystal Empire, but demanded that the Crystal Empire pay tribute to the Changelings, to ensure that those who had returned to their original forms would no longer be hungry. The “Crystal Empire Ceasefire” was signed in the autumn of 1001, and the truce would be officially confirmed in the Canterlot Pact later, and thus everything was settled. The Crystal Ponies knew that an era had ended...

[zh.FOCUS_C15_CRYSTAL_EMPIRE_TRUCE]
《水晶帝国停战协定》

[zh.FOCUS_C15_CRYSTAL_EMPIRE_TRUCE_desc]
1000年秋，此时的“三巨头”已经征服了几乎整个小马利亚中央大陆，提雷克回到家乡后，和煦和邪茧将下一个目标放在了水晶帝国。但很显然，从秋天开始入侵一个北方极寒之地的国家，是一个糟糕透顶的选择。在1000年冬天的严寒下，和煦和邪茧的军队推进缓慢。在音韵公主和银甲的领导下，水晶帝国组织起了一队不可小觑的防御力量，水晶之心为水晶帝国的军队提供着强大的力场保护。战争似乎陷入了僵局，但水晶帝国的资源正在缓慢枯竭，战线在一点一点收缩。\n到了来年夏天，寒冬已经不再能保护水晶帝国，和煦和邪茧的军队再次发动了夏季攻势，先锋部队艰难推进到了水晶城下，但他们却依旧无法攻破水晶之心的强大力场。随着夏天很快变成秋天，冬天又不远了。对于水晶帝国来说，寒冬既是一种庇护，又是一把抵在后背的匕首：和煦与邪茧必然要赶在冬天之前攻破水晶之心，但若是水晶之心的力场被攻破，那么水晶帝国与侵略军将会一同被风之魔的严寒所吞没。最终，和煦与邪茧不得不向水晶帝国示弱，同时，即使是曾经最坚决的音韵夫妇，也不得不坐到了谈判桌前。\n\n“三巨头”和水晶帝国决定各退一步：和煦光流女皇许诺水晶帝国自由，但要求音韵夫妇退位，水晶帝国名义上臣服，去军事化，并且政府由小马利亚帝国参与管理；邪茧女王将一同保证水晶帝国的独立，但要求水晶帝国向幻形灵进贡爱意，以保证那些变回原型的幻形灵们不再有饥饿。1001年秋《水晶帝国停战协定》签署，并且停战协定将在会之后被附属在《坎特洛特协定》中正式确认下来，一切尘埃落定。水晶小马们知道，一个时代结束了...

